{
  "id": "33723_sumitsuku",
  "headword": "{住|す}み{着|つ}く",
  "reading": "すみつく",
  "romaji": "sumitsuku",
  "part_of_speech": "verb (godan)",
  "gloss": "to settle (in a place); to take up residence",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to settle; to take up residence (for good)",
      "explanation": "To come to a place and stay there for good, making it one's home; also of animals or birds that start living somewhere, often uninvited."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "33723_sumitsuku_ex1",
      "japanese": "⟦{猫|ねこ}→猫：02237_neko⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{庭|にわ}→庭：02239_niwa⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{住|す}み{着|つ}いた。",
      "english": "A cat has settled in our garden.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": true,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "33723_sumitsuku_ex2",
      "japanese": "⟦{彼|かれ}→彼：01292_kare⟧⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧⟦{京都|きょうと}→京都：09484_kyouto⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{住|す}み{着|つ}いた。",
      "english": "He settled down in Kyoto.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": true,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "33723_sumitsuku_ex3",
      "japanese": "⟦{屋根裏|やねうら}→屋根裏：15854_yaneura⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦ハクビシン→ハクビシン：32934_hakubishin⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{住|す}み{着|つ}いてしまい、⟦{夜|よる}→夜：00487_yoru⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦なる→なる：01970_naru⟧⟦と→と：00512_to⟧⟦{物音|ものおと}→物音：03633_monooto⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧。",
      "english": "A masked palm civet has taken up residence in the attic, and there are noises at night.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": true,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "⟦{住|す}む→住む：00673_sumu⟧ (to live) plus ⟦{着|つ}く→着く：00680_tsuku⟧ (to arrive, to stick). It stresses staying for good; for animals and pests, it often sounds unwelcome.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{田舎|いなか}→田舎：01320_inaka⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{住|す}み{着|つ}く: to settle in the countryside\n- ⟦{野良猫|のらねこ}→野良猫：14440_noraneko⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{住|す}み{着|つ}く: a stray cat moves in\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{定住|ていじゅう}→定住：12524_teijuu⟧⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to settle permanently; formal\n- ⟦{移住|いじゅう}する→移住する：17190_ijuusuru⟧: to move and settle (often abroad); stresses the move",
